# Tutorial provenance is published: starter inputs, plots, tables, plans,
# and HTML reports. Trajectories, coordinates, topologies, and force fields
# stay local through the patterns above (*.xtc *.trr *.gro *.tpr *.top *.ff/).
# Re-include only the four starting structures, not solvated copies.
!tutorial/pseudo_apo_holo/*.pdb
# GROMACS backups and generated intermediates under the tutorial run.
tutorial/**/*#
tutorial/**/*.ndx
tutorial/**/*.itp
tutorial/**/*.out
tutorial/**/*.pkl
tutorial/**/*.npz
tutorial/**/*.pid
tutorial/**/.agentic_job_id
tutorial/**/hpc/*_run.sh

# Generated planner cache. Rebuilt from agentic/planner/knowledge/.
agentic/planner/knowledge_index.json

